<title>FRANCE: GdEaux wins Gabon water,electricity deal.</title>
<headline>GdEaux wins Gabon water,electricity deal.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compagnie Generale des Eaux said it had won a tender for the privatisation of Gabon's SEEG company which represents a 20-year concession with total sales of 14 billion francs.</p>
<p>The Gabon government has sold all shares of the Societe d'Electricite d'Eau de Gabon (SEEG) to Generale des Eaux which will float 49 percent of the capital on the bourse in the coming weeks.</p>
<p>Generale will assure the production of drinking water and electricity for all Gabon.</p>
</text>
